{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> shown, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is some interior point, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/1/671fcdad94abd4db28c0060628336bc3f70aebe8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y, z, w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"11\" /> are the measures of angles\nin degrees. Solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/9488a1599539128afb5aeff0927de2be6410ebd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y, z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/9/2399ef53c5ca3aa28698a8213a9aeb2fe7a397de.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((0,0)--(10,0)--(2,7)--cycle); draw((0,0)--(4,3)--(10,0)); label(&quot;A&quot;, (0,0), SW); label(&quot;B&quot;, (10,0), SE); label(&quot;C&quot;, (2,7), W); label(&quot;D&quot;, (4,3), N); label(&quot;x&quot;, (2.25,6)); label(&quot;y&quot;, (1.5,2), SW); label(&quot;$z$&quot;, (7.88,1.5)); label(&quot;w&quot;, (4,2.85), S); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"178\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c68a6274dcb45df982be5630a1b97d4ea700f59a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ w-y-z \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ w-2y-2z \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 180-w-y-z \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ 2w-y-z\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 180-w+y+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"466\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By angles in a quadrilateral, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b64091c64cf001e8fe35be694546742e1e4786e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 360^{\\circ} - \\text{reflex } \\angle ADB - y - z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"256\" height=\"16\" />, and by angles at a point, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef6175098df27b5b307aede79c6f4cdf21eb18ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{reflex } \\angle ADB = 360^{\\circ} - w$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"196\" height=\"13\" />, so our expression becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/c/f5c06ac68d180d0c2b6f52a2c52eb1ccbf3d0b15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^{\\circ} - (360^{\\circ} - w) - y - z = w - y - z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"305\" height=\"18\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79e0e8ce41b5c08729443bcc258d13ca061ff35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{A}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selfl